	<ThingDef ParentName="ABYautja_ArmorBiocoded_Base">
		<defName>ABYautja_Armor_ChestplateElite</defName>
		<label>elite predator hunter chestplate</label>
		<description>Finely crafted and optimised for the most honorable Yautja warriors. The Elite Armor is exactly what it's name suggests: Elite. Excellent protection with freedom of movement. Comfortable and heated. It does it all, because the elite warrant the Elite(tm).</description>
